                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>Willy Brandt (1913-1992) - Chancelier fédéral allemand</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\">INFORMATIONS UND EXERCISES</span></strong></p>\n"
